{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Am I in place of Elohim</b> — in the same expression that Jacob answered Rachel when she asked him to seek mercy for her, and he rebuked her with it — in that same expression he answered his brothers. Therefore it is three times in the Masorah; the third: התחת זאת לא יומת שמעי — for in that same expression that he said to his brothers, retribution was taken from Shimei; his brothers learned from him to speak in his expression."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {0 "The three Masorah occurrences are Genesis 30:2 (Jacob to Rachel), Genesis 50:19 (Joseph to his brothers), and 1 Kings 2:44 (David to Shimei). The phrase התחת appears in all three."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:52.706973765Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}